{
  "label": "day154",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label day154:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves1.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s day-two of helping my new students move into their dorms and, today, I’m accompanied by none other than Miku and Futaba.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And when I say “I’m accompanied,” it’s really closer to me accompanying them.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo didn’t actually invite me to help, I just heard about it in class and decided to show up unannounced.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But hey, virtually every visit I’ve had to the dorms has been unannounced so far. Might as well not do anything to break the streak.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey. What are you two up to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves2.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, hey Sensei! I didn’t know you were comin’ today!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Neither did I, to be honest. Just sort of happened.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you here to help Tsuneyo move as well?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know it. Anything I can do to help.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Does sitting around drinking water really constitute helping, though? It doesn’t seem like you’re doing much.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! Watch it! We did plenty of stuff before you got here!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": God forbid we take a second to drink some water. Jeez, kids these days!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please forgive her tone, Sensei...Miku’s actually worked really hard today.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s heckin’ right, I have. And so has Futaba! We’ve carried like a bajillion different boxes and like, 90%% of ‘em have been clothes!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve...done my best. I can’t exactly carry as much as Miku.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, but that’s probs just cause those big ole’ honkers keep gettin’ in the way.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s not...entirely incorrect. I wish you’d be a little less abrasive, though.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves5.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! Translation request! The heck does ‘abrasive’ mean?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It means Futaba wants you to be a little less candid when you talk about her chest.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oooooh. I see, I see.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The heck does ‘candid’ mean?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It means that you shouldn’t make fun of Futaba’s boobs.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I ain’t makin’ fun of em! I’d kill for those puppies! I’m not even wearin’ a friggin bra right now.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I’d kill to be able to do that...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Ahh, I’ve reached the point of my life where my students are no longer concerned with talking about their chests in front of me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hard work really does pay off.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves7.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry, you two. But as much as I’d like to stay and talk about boobs with you, would you mind telling me where Tsuneyo is?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like I’m obligated to at least try to help her tonight.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That and I’d also like her to be a part of this conversation as well. I haven’t seen much of Tsuneyo, but I definitely think her body is rather...developed for her age.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm? You blind, Sensei? She’s right behind ya.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, really?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I turn around and-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hi, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you need help with those boxes?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m fine.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have to carry much heavier things at the restaurant.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, but I’m sure you can normally see when you carry those things.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is a good point.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So can I take a box then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo’s expressionless face pops into my vision as I take a box full of her clothes from the top of the stack.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come here often?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you hitting on me right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think so.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? Because it sounds a lot like you’re hitting on me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t even know what that means.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That aside, how are you feeling about the move? Have you gotten used to Molly yet?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo looks off to the side instead of answering my question.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I assume this means she-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that a bird?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves11.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that thing really still there? I figured it would have left by now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We should give it a name.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You want to name a bird that’s probably going to fly away in a day or two?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, I kind of do as well.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let’s name him Noodles.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You need interests besides noodles, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves12.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fuck you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "WOAH.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Where the hell did that come from?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...did I do something to offend you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The only thing that offends me is when someone only eats half of their dinner.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You haven’t eaten dinner. You are fine.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then why did you curse at me?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves13.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Curse? What does that mean?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You said “Fuck you” just now. The word “fuck” is a curse.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves14.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh no. What have I done?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo suddenly drops her boxes on the floor in front of her. A loud thud rings out and likely echoes throughout the first dorm floor.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo, your computer was in one of those boxes...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you going to die?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Why would I die?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The curse.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...It’s not that kind of curse.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves15.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...you will live?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will very much live.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves16.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve been bestowed with too much power...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have absolutely no idea what you’re talking about.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves17.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That curse was taught to me by the Emerald Guardian.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo, it’s not that kind of curse.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even if it is a weak curse, I shouldn’t have placed it on you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am sorry. You may eat for free at my family’s shop whenever you like for the rest of your life.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, that’s fine. I’ll still pay.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves18.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ay! The heck are you two doin’ over there? And why’d ramen-girl drop her computer on the ground?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You gotta be careful with loud noises like that! You never know who might freak out and get scared from ‘em.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyomoves19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyomoves19.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyomoves19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I turn around to find an uncharacteristically angry looking Miku, though I imagine I know why.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The only time I’ve ever seen her lose her composure was after that ball hit the storage room that one time.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I guess I should be glad that she didn’t have another reaction like that now.",
